    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Monday January 28 2019 saw SONAM Kenya welcome a fresh crop of nurses and midwives to its Bachelor of Science in Nursing and Midwifery classes. The new students were on campus for a three-day orientation before the semester officially begins this February. The orientation is designed to help the students get acquainted with the school and how it functions in order to prepare them for the beginning of classes.",
